"rules_classic_combined" = "Classic Mode Rules:\n1. Slide tiles with the same number to merge them (e.g., 2 + 2 = 4).\n2.  When a tile merges with an obstacle, subtract its square from the obstacle (e.g., 2048 - 2² = 2044).\n3. Win by reducing the obstacle to 0 or below; lose if you run out of moves.";

"rules_combinedProMax" = "ProMax Mode Rules:\n1. Merge same numbers into their square; different numbers merge into the absolute value of their difference.\n2.  When tiles merge downward into obstacles, subtract the square of the number from the obstacle.\n3. Win by reducing the obstacle to 0 or below; lose if you run out of moves.";
